    {
      "id": "f1192cf0-2d20-4e55-a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 4560,
      "width": 733.1999999999999,
      "height": 117.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eb78c045-678a-41e1-8"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1264822209,
      "versionNonce": 1401253661,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785143082781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. V_user = [budget, usage, prestige, passagers]\n2. V_annonce = [prix, type, cause, places, finitions]\n3. Les deux vecteurs vivent dans l'espace Embeddings de Qdrant (dim = 384).\n4. On calcule sim = cosine(V_user, V_annonce). Plus l'angle est petit, plus le match est fort.\n\nAvantage: pr\u00e9dictible, explicable, sans historique requis.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. V_user = [budget, usage, prestige, passagers]\n2. V_annonce = [prix, type, cause, places, finitions]\n3. Les deux vecteurs vivent dans l'espace Embeddings de Qdrant (dim = 384).\n4. On calcule sim = cosine(V_user, V_annonce). Plus l'angle est petit, plus le match est fort.\n\nAvantage: pr\u00e9dictible, explicable, sans historique requis.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 2,
      "index": "a0",
      "autoResize": true
    },
